stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: Order Paid (Job Created)
    QUEUED --> CUTTING: Fabric rolls allocated & master pattern marked (POINT OF NO RETURN)
    CUTTING --> SEWING: Panels bundled & assigned to artisan
    SEWING --> WASHING: Assembly completed (Chainstitch, flat felled seams)
    WASHING --> HARDWARE: Rinse/dry complete (Custom shrinkage settled)
    HARDWARE --> QC: Solid silver/brass buttons, rivets & leather patch fixed
    
    QC --> READY: Measurements match tolerance (±0.25")
    QC --> SEWING: Defect identified (Rework loop)
    
    READY --> SHIPPED: Handed to courier with packing slip & tote
    SHIPPED --> [*]

